1
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:22,860
Jory Boy has returned!

2
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:34,460
What just happened to me?

3
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:36,330
Weird.

4
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:44,380
I shouldn't be able to get up, right?

5
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:52,820
Even though I lost the fight,
For some reason, I'm having fun!

6
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:56,400
Joy Boy?

7
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:58,100
Luffy's Joy Boy?

8
00:00:58,340 --> 00:01:00,000
Is that what Sunisha said?

9
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:01,800
What is he talking about?

10
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:11,500
I was starting to worry.

11
00:01:12,080 --> 00:01:14,080
Are you okay, Mr. Pirate?

12
00:01:15,100 --> 00:01:15,930
Luffy!

13
00:01:22,020 --> 00:01:22,850
What?

14
00:01:22,933 --> 00:01:24,540
Is that you, Mr. Straw Hat?

15
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:27,040
It is him. Hey!

16
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:28,780
Straw Hat's up there!

17
00:01:28,940 --> 00:01:29,940
He's still alive!

18
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,880
So Kaido is lying after all?

19
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:34,452
You're telling me Big Bro is really okay?

20
00:01:36,020 --> 00:01:37,840
I'm so happy!

21
00:01:42,220 --> 00:01:44,880
We sacrificed one of our best agents.

22
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:47,760
And now Kaido is furious.

23
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:52,376
I still prefer it to the alternative.

24
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:55,180
We eliminated a risk factor like no other.

25
00:01:56,440 --> 00:02:00,734
Although we can't know for certain,
this could have been a true disaster.

26
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:03,700
We must seize the Gum-Gum fruit.

27
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:06,777
For ages the world government
has chased after it,

28
00:02:06,860 --> 00:02:10,300
and for ages it has eluded
our grasp. What a joke.

29
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:14,200
We have allowed this embarrassment
to go on for generations.

30
00:02:14,620 --> 00:02:16,617
800 years to be precise.

31
00:02:16,700 --> 00:02:18,320
It's quite vexing.

32
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:23,980
It sounds foolish, but it's almost as
if the fruit is trying to evade us.

33
00:02:24,780 --> 00:02:27,100
That's not entirely implausible.

34
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:31,820
Zoan-type devil fruits can
have a will of their own.

35
00:02:32,140 --> 00:02:36,460
If that's so, this fruit
would be rather willful.

36
00:02:36,660 --> 00:02:40,640
After all, its true name
bears the title of a god.

37
00:02:40,980 --> 00:02:43,520
The Zoan human-human fruit.

38
00:02:44,140 --> 00:02:45,460
Mythical type.

39
00:02:46,420 --> 00:02:47,250
Model.

40
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:50,190
Nika.

41
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:57,660
From head to toe, his body was as
elastic as rubber itself, they say.

42
00:02:58,180 --> 00:03:03,960
He fought and frolicked as he fancied,
bringing a smile to people wherever he went.

43
00:03:04,300 --> 00:03:06,680
The warrior of liberation.

44
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:10,620
Or as others called him, Nika.

45
00:03:11,820 --> 00:03:13,500
The Sun God.

46
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:19,997
the fruit's awakened power
is said to impart even

47
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:24,117
greater might to its holder
but what it truly grants is

48
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:30,097
freedom strength as broad
as the imagination the most

49
00:03:30,180 --> 00:03:34,560
ridiculous power in the world
one that we could not contain

50
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:51,060
Komurasaki is here or in!

51
00:03:53,580 --> 00:03:54,639
This is a mistake!

52
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:56,580
I loved Odin too, you know!

53
00:03:58,680 --> 00:04:00,240
Let's rethink this!

54
00:04:00,780 --> 00:04:04,133
Kaido exploited me, but those
days are all behind us now!

55
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:10,300
So please, pull out this nail!

56
00:04:10,580 --> 00:04:12,220
I can help us both escape!

57
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:16,140
Who would listen to you now?

58
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:18,100
You think me a fool?

59
00:04:23,420 --> 00:04:27,640
My father, he kept his promise to you.

60
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,620
He trusted you.

61
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:35,220
You told him that Kaido would leave,
that you would free the land of Wano.

62
00:04:37,020 --> 00:04:42,420
He spent five years playing the
fool and dancing as you asked.

63
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:46,660
He never made a single
excuse to his family.

64
00:04:53,220 --> 00:04:54,808
He honored your conditions.

65
00:04:57,900 --> 00:05:01,724
Then he believed that you'd keep
your word and set everyone free.

66
00:05:02,420 --> 00:05:06,080
So he withstood boiling oil for an hour.

67
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:09,260
He allowed himself to be cooked alive.

68
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:13,240
He always, always had a smile on his face.

69
00:05:14,700 --> 00:05:17,380
But the whole nation was taken hostage.

70
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:21,780
And he was carrying that burden
all by himself in silence.

71
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:25,200
I can't imagine the pain he felt.

72
00:05:34,840 --> 00:05:36,560
What's the matter, Hiyori?

73
00:05:38,380 --> 00:05:42,160
Father, are you okay with
people talking bad about you?

74
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:44,066
It doesn't bother me one bit.

75
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:45,360
Why not?

76
00:05:45,640 --> 00:05:48,920
Because I have you, my family. Really?

77
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:51,456
Then I want to stay with you forever!

78
00:05:56,420 --> 00:05:58,000
You know what?

79
00:05:58,260 --> 00:06:00,977
That Odin was one hell
of a samurai, wasn't he?

80
00:06:01,060 --> 00:06:06,000
As shogun, I can give him a posthumous
award, or perhaps a monument.

81
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:16,500
I'm the shogun's daughter, Kozuki Hiyori.

82
00:06:19,180 --> 00:06:21,680
When you speak to me, mind your tongue.

83
00:06:25,880 --> 00:06:27,560
Even when I was starving,

84
00:06:27,960 --> 00:06:29,617
even when I was dressed in rags,

85
00:06:29,700 --> 00:06:33,406
I carried with me the honor that
my father brought to our name.

86
00:06:33,820 --> 00:06:36,477
You have never been a
shogun a day in your life.

87
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:39,089
You're nothing but a
thief and an imposter.

88
00:06:40,020 --> 00:06:42,300
You're a lowly worm and a coward.

89
00:06:42,520 --> 00:06:45,637
And the longer you live your
pathetic excuse of a life,

90
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:47,460
the more innocent people die.

91
00:06:49,380 --> 00:06:50,540
Please have mercy.

92
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:51,819
I can't even move.

93
00:06:52,140 --> 00:06:53,640
Don't lay a finger on me.

94
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:55,913
Revenge is meaningless.

95
00:06:56,160 --> 00:06:57,336
Think of the future.

96
00:06:58,380 --> 00:07:02,800
Killing me is pointless It still
won't get rid of Tydo, right?

97
00:07:04,560 --> 00:07:05,880
Lord, Orochi

98
00:07:07,340 --> 00:07:10,640
I have failed you, my task

99
00:07:11,420 --> 00:07:13,640
Contero, is it really you?

100
00:07:14,100 --> 00:07:15,980
Alas, I'm finished,

101
00:07:16,260 --> 00:07:17,620
my lord Actually,

102
00:07:17,820 --> 00:07:19,497
you're just in time Why,

103
00:07:19,580 --> 00:07:25,000
there's a new stage for you right
before me Burn this bitch to death Go,

104
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:26,807
my friend, and make it quick

105
00:07:30,420 --> 00:07:34,540
A woman who endured for 20 years
fails to get her revenge in the end.

106
00:07:34,860 --> 00:07:37,680
It's a tragic comedy for
the ages, I tell you.

107
00:07:38,100 --> 00:07:39,340
Do you get it now?

108
00:07:39,640 --> 00:07:43,300
You're just a relic of the Kozuki Kyori.

109
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,320
The chosen.

110
00:07:45,820 --> 00:07:47,180
The strong like me.

111
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:50,285
We are blessed with
fortune from heaven itself.

112
00:07:57,520 --> 00:07:59,020
No! Stop it!

113
00:07:59,380 --> 00:08:01,027
Why are you coming this way?

114
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:06,640
Konkuro, you imbecile!

115
00:08:07,020 --> 00:08:09,080
Iori, you have to help me!

116
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:18,600
The dawn, it will surely come.

117
00:08:19,860 --> 00:08:23,820
The Kozuki clan always
keeps their promises.

118
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:33,460
I can do everything I ever wanted!

119
00:08:36,260 --> 00:08:38,980
Yep, I think I can get back to the fight!

120
00:08:40,300 --> 00:08:43,080
Wow, my heartbeat sure sounds funny!

121
00:08:48,580 --> 00:08:50,300
I can feel it!

122
00:08:50,500 --> 00:08:51,380
This is it!

123
00:08:51,580 --> 00:08:53,000
This is my peak!

124
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:56,960
All right!

125
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:01,220
And get it!

126
00:09:07,700 --> 00:09:09,460
Why is everybody passing out?

127
00:09:09,700 --> 00:09:11,818
Are we getting hit with Tom Curzaki?

128
00:09:12,160 --> 00:09:13,600
Where's it coming from?

129
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,680
What the hell's going on?

130
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:21,797
There's something up there.

131
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:22,710
There.

132
00:09:22,793 --> 00:09:23,623
On the roof.

133
00:09:41,560 --> 00:09:42,820
Commander Kaido!

134
00:09:43,780 --> 00:09:45,800
Is that really Straw Hat?

135
00:09:45,980 --> 00:09:46,860
Help me!

136
00:09:51,880 --> 00:09:52,710
Ah!

137
00:09:56,500 --> 00:09:58,140
Ha-ha-ha!

138
00:09:58,740 --> 00:09:59,570
Whoa!

139
00:10:00,100 --> 00:10:01,500
Monkey-dee muscles!

140
00:10:02,020 --> 00:10:02,850
Muscles!

141
00:10:10,860 --> 00:10:12,920
Here we go!

142
00:10:15,280 --> 00:10:16,110
Whoa!

143
00:10:16,580 --> 00:10:17,410
Whoa!

144
00:10:17,493 --> 00:10:18,600
And loop-dee-go!

145
00:10:25,900 --> 00:10:27,220
Uh!

146
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:28,740
Huh?

147
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:30,260
Gah!

148
00:10:31,060 --> 00:10:32,380
You're all right.

149
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:34,580
Huh? Huh?

150
00:10:38,180 --> 00:10:39,500
Huh?

151
00:10:39,820 --> 00:10:41,140
Huh?

152
00:10:41,900 --> 00:10:42,730
Huh?

153
00:10:47,160 --> 00:10:48,480
Ah!

154
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:17,037
Straw Hat, you're alive.

155
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:19,300
I am grateful.

156
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:38,760
Blast Prince!

157
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:06,400
Take this back!

158
00:12:07,140 --> 00:12:07,970
Mummy.

159
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:18,300
Ha-ha-ha!

160
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:39,840
Ha-ha-ha-ha!

161
00:12:40,100 --> 00:12:41,440
Ha-ha-ha-ha!

162
00:12:42,780 --> 00:12:44,460
Fifth gear!

163
00:12:50,660 --> 00:12:54,240
My apologies for what
that fool did to you.

164
00:12:58,780 --> 00:13:01,120
I didn't want to win that way.

165
00:13:01,500 --> 00:13:02,960
Not like that.

166
00:13:05,540 --> 00:13:06,820
No problem.

167
00:13:07,940 --> 00:13:09,940
Time to settle this then.

168
00:13:28,680 --> 00:13:31,120
Well, aren't you full of surprises?

169
00:13:31,580 --> 00:13:33,560
I was certain you had died.

170
00:13:35,840 --> 00:13:36,980
Me too!

171
00:13:39,740 --> 00:13:43,975
I've seen your rubber power is affecting
things outside of yourself now.

172
00:13:44,180 --> 00:13:48,117
I assume this means your parametheon
powers have reached their awakening.

173
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:50,560
But your body, the way it changed,

174
00:13:51,260 --> 00:13:53,300
it feels like something else.

175
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:57,176
Almost like you've gone
through a Zoan transformation.

176
00:14:09,660 --> 00:14:12,180
Let me out of here, it's dark!

177
00:14:15,300 --> 00:14:16,940
Stop eating me!

178
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:20,550
Muscle...

179
00:14:20,633 --> 00:14:21,463
power!

180
00:14:33,460 --> 00:14:35,360
Hey, turn out the lights!

181
00:14:51,700 --> 00:14:53,900
I'm like a shooting star!

182
00:14:54,220 --> 00:14:56,000
Call me Lucy Satori!

183
00:14:56,180 --> 00:14:58,004
I'm shooting through your body!

184
00:15:06,160 --> 00:15:07,680
Gum-Gum!

185
00:15:12,820 --> 00:15:15,020
What the hell are you doing in there?

186
00:15:17,340 --> 00:15:18,800
What a bastard!

187
00:15:23,380 --> 00:15:24,420
Wait, Kainu?

188
00:15:24,580 --> 00:15:26,286
Why is he flirting like that?

189
00:15:26,460 --> 00:15:29,720
I'm not sure, but he seems
to have put on weight.

190
00:15:33,080 --> 00:15:35,021
Maybe he's trying out a new form.

191
00:15:42,560 --> 00:15:44,800
How the hell is he doing this to me?

192
00:15:45,620 --> 00:15:47,840
My body's not made of rubber.

193
00:15:51,800 --> 00:15:53,980
I sure am having fun.

194
00:15:55,340 --> 00:15:57,460
Oh, I see two lights.

195
00:15:59,520 --> 00:16:02,020
Ten seconds to launch.

196
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:06,760
Oh, yeah!

197
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:14,780
Hey, lift off!

198
00:16:15,620 --> 00:16:17,502
Don't go make a game for a game!

199
00:17:06,100 --> 00:17:06,930
Luffy?

200
00:17:07,013 --> 00:17:09,480
This time I got an even better idea!

201
00:17:10,760 --> 00:17:12,120
Home combat!

202
00:17:30,660 --> 00:17:33,717
What am I even looking at right now?

203
00:17:33,800 --> 00:17:37,700
Voice he sounds just like Luffy
what you think that thing is

204
00:18:03,800 --> 00:18:04,630
No!

205
00:18:12,640 --> 00:18:13,980
Blast burn!

206
00:18:15,060 --> 00:18:16,340
Ah! Shit!

207
00:18:22,700 --> 00:18:23,860
Dispickable!

208
00:18:27,560 --> 00:18:29,357
Hehehehehehe! Eh!

209
00:18:29,440 --> 00:18:31,517
Ha

210
00:18:31,600 --> 00:18:37,720
-ha-ha!

211
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:44,300
Straw Hat!

212
00:18:45,940 --> 00:18:48,040
I'm gone!

213
00:18:49,060 --> 00:18:51,900
Conqueror of three! Wow!

214
00:18:58,040 --> 00:18:58,870
Agaraku!

215
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:06,520
That's hurt!

216
00:19:15,740 --> 00:19:17,260
That Straw Hat?

217
00:19:17,420 --> 00:19:19,479
Well, he certainly looks different.

218
00:19:27,920 --> 00:19:30,080
Is this a damn comic strip?

219
00:19:41,580 --> 00:19:46,404
You put on a good show, but it seems all
your running around wore you out already.

220
00:19:47,280 --> 00:19:48,110
Pity.

221
00:19:48,193 --> 00:19:50,400
Your best isn't enough to beat me.

222
00:19:54,580 --> 00:19:55,960
You think so?

223
00:19:58,060 --> 00:20:00,200
I got plenty left in the tank.

224
00:20:19,300 --> 00:20:20,497
I pooped.

225
00:20:20,580 --> 00:20:22,420
What happened to your face?

226
00:20:31,320 --> 00:20:32,600
Almost forgot.

227
00:20:33,120 --> 00:20:34,420
I was dead.

228
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:36,480
Or halfway there, anyway.

229
00:20:37,600 --> 00:20:40,640
No wonder this wore me out so much.

230
00:20:40,960 --> 00:20:42,900
You can die in peace this time.

231
00:20:43,320 --> 00:20:47,496
The story of the battle you fought
will be passed down for generations.

232
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:51,220
That's not what I want.

233
00:20:51,720 --> 00:20:52,960
That's stupid.

234
00:20:53,660 --> 00:20:54,490
Huh?

235
00:20:57,100 --> 00:21:00,680
When you're dead, you're just bones.

236
00:21:05,340 --> 00:21:06,960
It really is him.

237
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:10,917
With those white clothes and that white
hair, he looked like a different person.

238
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:11,880
I'm worried.

239
00:21:12,240 --> 00:21:15,080
He's back, but his voice is fading away.

240
00:21:15,580 --> 00:21:16,840
It's not over.

241
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:18,860
Because I'm still alive.

242
00:21:19,120 --> 00:21:22,560
We've got to give Wano a
happy ending. Right, Momo?

243
00:21:23,680 --> 00:21:24,510
Right!

244
00:21:24,780 --> 00:21:26,180
For Tama!

245
00:21:28,760 --> 00:21:30,440
For Kin'emon!

246
00:21:31,820 --> 00:21:33,260
For Pedro!

247
00:21:35,980 --> 00:21:37,760
No, no, no, no!

248
00:21:38,260 --> 00:21:40,240
It's time to die.

249
00:21:44,880 --> 00:21:47,320
Is that supposed to scare me?

250
00:21:47,860 --> 00:21:50,820
It wouldn't even be the first time today.

251
00:21:57,960 --> 00:21:59,440
Come on, heart.

252
00:22:00,460 --> 00:22:02,240
Beat louder for me.

253
00:22:15,260 --> 00:22:17,080
Now that's more like it!

254
00:22:26,900 --> 00:22:27,730
Alright!

255
00:22:27,813 --> 00:22:28,643
This is the beast!

256
00:22:31,600 --> 00:22:32,720
Be careful!

257
00:22:33,040 --> 00:22:33,960
Behind you!

258
00:22:47,600 --> 00:22:49,000
No!

259
00:22:55,200 --> 00:22:56,200
Oh! Ah! Yeah!

260
00:22:57,160 --> 00:22:57,990
Ah!

261
00:22:59,380 --> 00:23:00,780
Oh!

262
00:23:25,660 --> 00:23:27,360
This is completely insane.

263
00:23:28,460 --> 00:23:29,337
Armament Haki.

264
00:23:29,420 --> 00:23:30,538
Conqueror's Haki.

265
00:23:30,680 --> 00:23:32,680
This strange white transformation.

266
00:23:32,780 --> 00:23:36,217
This freedom that seems to be
warping the world around him.

267
00:23:36,300 --> 00:23:38,359
I've never seen anything like that.

268
00:23:38,480 --> 00:23:41,060
Up here, up here! Follow me!

269
00:23:48,500 --> 00:23:50,760
Oh, you're starting to get it?

270
00:23:51,560 --> 00:23:53,920
Gump, gump, caribou!

271
00:24:10,240 --> 00:24:14,580
Feels like I'm playing games with
a damn kid I'm sick of this crap

272
00:24:57,800 --> 00:25:01,840
We haven't fun yet, Kaido!

273
00:25:04,220 --> 00:25:05,057
Woohoo!

274
00:25:05,140 --> 00:25:06,300
That was strong!

275
00:25:06,740 --> 00:25:08,152
It was really funny too!

276
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:19,460
I can't make up my mind.

277
00:25:19,720 --> 00:25:22,014
Hey, what should I call that technique?

278
00:25:22,400 --> 00:25:23,459
Gum-Gum something.

279
00:25:25,260 --> 00:25:27,140
Gum-gum-blah.

280
00:25:27,460 --> 00:25:29,000
Gum-gum-rah.

281
00:25:29,960 --> 00:25:32,880
Are you still Straw Hat?

282
00:25:34,920 --> 00:25:36,040
Oh, yeah.

283
00:25:36,420 --> 00:25:37,480
That's me.

284
00:25:48,120 --> 00:25:49,837
Oh, Joy Boy!

285
00:25:49,920 --> 00:25:53,837
How long it's been since
I felt this rhythm?

286
00:25:53,920 --> 00:25:56,077
Can you hear me, Joy Boy?

287
00:25:56,160 --> 00:25:59,020
It feels as if you're right beside me.

288
00:25:59,460 --> 00:26:02,260
My heart is dancing with excitement.

289
00:26:04,040 --> 00:26:09,157
I cannot help but feel that
fate is at work I cannot help

290
00:26:09,240 --> 00:26:14,520
but put my faith in this young
man You want to know who I am?

291
00:26:15,140 --> 00:26:16,300
Monkey D.

292
00:26:16,680 --> 00:26:23,200
Luffy The man who'll surpass you
And then become King of the Pirates
